{
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.DescribeAttacked.DamageText": " <b>(<font color=\"{0}\">{1}</font>)</b>"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.HandleFear.TheSkeletonSeems": "The skeleton seems to be unfazed by your display of illusionary terror. It continues its attack as normal![pg]"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.Heal.OneIs": "\n{0}{1} is healed! <b>(<font color=\"{2}\">{3}</font>)</b>"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.Heal.TheBoneSorcerer": "The Bone Sorcerer speaks in an unknown tongue, weaving an arcane spell!"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.Heal.TheBoneSorcerer2": "\nThe Bone Sorcerer is healed! <b>(<font color=\"{0}\">{1}</font>)</b>"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.Mark.TheBoneSorcerer": "The Bone Sorcerer reads his ragged parchment and points at you! It's difficult for you to comprehend, but you feel unlucky, as if your enemies will easily find gaps in your armor. You have been <b>hexed</b>!"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.Text": " [b:Critical hit!]"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.You01": "You {0} {1}, sending shards of {2} flying!"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.You0With": "You [b:shatter] {0} with your powerful {1}!"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.YouStrikeA": "You strike a glancing blow on {0}!"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.Your0Bounces": "Your {0} bounces harmlessly off {1}."
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.Zero": "{0}"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.ReplacesDescribeAttacked.ZeroCracksUnder": "{0} cracks under your powerful {1}!"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.TemptingGoblet.TheBoneSorcerer": "The Bone Sorcerer rears its goblet-carrying arm back and throws it forward, launching some of the unknown liquid within it towards you!"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.TemptingGoblet.TheLiquidHits": "\nThe liquid hits you, corroding through your skin, causing immense pain. After the initial hit, you feel warmer and aroused, despite your grim situation. Why would a reanimated skeleton be drinking such a thing?"
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.TemptingGoblet.YouManageTo": "\nYou manage to use quick movements to lead the Courtier's throw away from your real position."
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.TemptingGoblet.YouReFast": "\nYou're fast enough to distance yourself from the liquid, and avoid the attack."
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.TemptingGoblet.YouRollAway": "\nYou roll away from the substance in time."
  "Combat.BoneCourtier.TemptingGoblet.YouTwistOut": "\nYou twist out of the way, making the most of your cat-like reflexes to avoid the strange substance."
}
